e.g., negative total price).\n\nTo confirm, we need to inspect the binary for key functions or test the vulnerability directly via netcat. The binary is 32-bit, so analysis should account for 32-bit integer operations. Since strings extraction failed to reveal specific vulnerability code, we should proceed with dynamic testing or deeper static analysis using objdump/Ghidra.\n\n步骤 2:\n- 目的: 检查附件文件类型，确认是可执行文件还是源代码\n- 命令: {"tool": "ctf_file_type", "purpose": "检查附件文件类型，确认是可执行文件还是源代码", "arguments": {"file_path": "/home/gem/workspace/attachments/source"}}\n- 输出:\ntype=\'text\' text="$ cd \'/home/gem\' && file \'/home/gem/workspace/attachments/source\'\\n/home/gem/workspace/attachments/source: ELF 32-bit LSB executable, Intel 80386, version 1 (SYSV), statically linked, Go BuildID=4B889tc1TRgpS9czhvct/FgQ1iPCpaksezCsvmIRb/JEuIrSM0u7bsenZgEPQP/pVFuNtB-YiGf_M2pZFLj, with debug_info, not stripped\\n[exit_code] 0" annotations=None meta=None\n- 分析: 附件source是32位ELF可执行文件，静态链接且包含调试符号，适合使用反汇编工具分析。由于直接读取文件编码失败，需要使用工具如objdump、strings或radare2来提取程序逻辑和字符串。根据解题思路，程序存在整数溢出漏洞，通过购买时输入负数量使总价格下溢，结账时可能触发flag输出。首先应运行程序观察行为，然后使用反汇编确认漏洞细节。\n\n步骤 1:\n- 目的: 读取题目附件的源代码，分析程序逻辑以识别漏洞\n- 命令: {"tool": "sandbox_read_file", "purpose": "读取题目附件的源代码，分析程序逻辑以识别漏洞", "arguments": {"path": "/home/gem/workspace/attachments/source"}}\n- 输出:\ntype=\'text\' text=\'[sandbox_read_file] 失败: headers: {\\\'server\\\': \\\'nginx/1.18.0 (Ubuntu)\\\', \\\'date\\\': \\\'Thu, 08 Jan 2026 04:05:54 GMT\\\', \\\'content-type\\\': \\\'application/json\\\', \\\'content-length\\\': \\\'155\\\', \\\'connection\\\': \\\'keep-alive\\\'}, status_code: 500, body: {\\\'success\\\': False, \\\'message\\\': "Failed to read file: Failed to read file: \\\'utf-8\\\' codec can\\\'t decode byte 0xc0 in position 24: invalid start byte", \\\'data\\\': None}\\nTraceback (most recent call last):\\n  File "E:\\\\ctf_agent\\\\src\\\\ctf_agent\\\\mcp_server\\\\server.py", line 285, in sandbox_read_file\\n    return await asyncio.to_thread(_call)\\n      