\\")\\n        else:\\n            print(\\"\\\\nFlag not found in this output, check the logs above.\\")\\n            \\n    except Exception as e:\\n        print(f\\"Error: {e}\\")\\n        sys.exit(1)\\n\\nif __name__ == \\"__main__\\":\\n    solve()"}}\n- 输出:\ntype=\'text\' text=\'Welcome to the market!\\n=====================\\nYou have 40 coins\\n\\tItem\\t\\tPrice\\tCount\\n(0) Quiet Quiches\\t10\\t12\\n(1) Average Apple\\t15\\t8\\n(2) Fruitful Flag\\t100\\t1\\n(3) Sell an Item\\n(4) Exit\\nChoose an option: \\n\\nHow many do you want to buy?\\n\\nYou have 55 coins\\n\\tItem\\t\\tPrice\\tCount\\n(0) Quiet Quiches\\t10\\t12\\n(1) Average Apple\\t15\\t9\\n(2) Fruitful Flag\\t100\\t1\\n(3) Sell an Item\\n(4) Exit\\nChoose an option: \\n\\nHow many do you want to buy?\\n\\nYou have 70 coins\\n\\tItem\\t\\tPrice\\tCount\\n(0) Quiet Quiches\\t10\\t12\\n(1) Average Apple\\t15\\t10\\n(2) Fruitful Flag\\t100\\t1\\n(3) Sell an Item\\n(4) Exit\\nChoose an option: \\n\\nHow many do you want to buy?\\n\\nYou have 85 coins\\n\\tItem\\t\\tPrice\\tCount\\n(0) Quiet Quiches\\t10\\t12\\n(1) Average Apple\\t15\\t11\\n\\n(2) Fruitful Flag\\t100\\t1\\n(3) Sell an Item\\n(4) Exit\\nChoose an option: \\n\\nHow many do you want to buy?\\n\\nYou have 100 coins\\n\\tItem\\t\\tPrice\\tCount\\n(0) Quiet Quiches\\t10\\t12\\n(1) Average Apple\\t15\\t12\\n(2) Fruitful Flag\\t100\\t1\\n(3) Sell an Item\\n(4) Exit\\nChoose an option: \\n\\nHow many do you want to buy?\\n\\nYou have 115 coins\\n\\tItem\\t\\tPrice\\tCount\\n(0) Quiet Quiches\\t10\\t12\\n(1) Average Apple\\t15\\t13\\n(2) Fruitful Flag\\t100\\t1\\n(3) Sell an Item\\n(4) Exit\\nChoose an option: \\n\\nFlag not found in this output, check the logs above.\' annotations=None meta=None\n- 分析: 分析失败: litellm.APIError: APIError: OpenAIException -\n\n步骤 8:\n- 目的: 编写并执行一个健壮的 Python 脚本，利用 pwntools 连接远程服务器，通过连续发送负数量触发整数下溢，使余额增加，然后结账并打印所有输出以获取 flag。\n- 命令: {"tool": "sandbox_python_exec", "purpose": "编写并执行一个健壮的 Python 脚本，利用 pwntools 连接远程服务